        "detail": "<div class=\"detailmodule_html\"><div class=\"detail-desc-decorate-richtext\"><div> </div><p><br/><br/><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(231, 76, 60)\"><strong>Features:</strong></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><br/><br/>   1. Environmental-friendly Material: Made of environmentally friendly <br/>Nature Bamboo material, the tee is durable and can be placed on the green.<br/>2. Superier Bamboo: The golf tee is made of superior Bamboo to increase the life of the ball.<br/>3.Reduces ball spin which increases control.<br/>4.Less resistance off the tee means more distance down the fairway.<br/>5.Easy to Carry: It is easy to carry and is very suitable for golf enthusiasts.<br/><br/>Material: Nature Bamboo<br/>Height(please choose): </span><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>5.4cm/2.1inch,7cm/2.8inch,8.3cm/3.3inch</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><br/>Color: #1/Beige, #2/white</span></p><div style=\"text-align:center\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><br/></span><img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/Sd43693cb07ac4a808064b6ea332aadc5Z.jpg?width=1000&amp;height=1000&amp;hash=2000\" slate-data-type=\"image\"/><img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/Sf220abc7696849e5bda2fd43cbdcfef5c.jpg?width=1000&amp;height=1000&amp;hash=2000\" slate-data-type=\"image\"/><img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/Sb16180fabc8844b58f274c214a449820S.jpg?width=1000&amp;height=1000&amp;hash=2000\" slate-data-type=\"image\"/><img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/S1562868a8c964f4fa613d2f1641183d1l.jpg?width=1000&amp;height=1000&amp;hash=2000\" slate-data-type=\"image\"/><img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/Sd2b820bcf0dc45e585f566b02ee63e12U.jpg?width=1000&amp;height=1000&amp;hash=2000\" slate-data-type=\"image\"/><img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/S87c0a02f298a473cb4ff4239d750eeace.jpg?width=1000&amp;height=1000&amp;hash=2000\" slate-data-type=\"image\"/><img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/Se4f7919203ed4534b5ba5de80